Subject: platform: browser console for Emscripten builds

New WasmDisplay (ANSI through AnsiScreenWriter to a page callback, for xterm.js),
WasmGridDisplay (cells into a uint32 grid the page draws itself) and WasmInput (a byte
queue parsed with TermIO). pollHandles waits on an EM_ASYNC_JS promise instead of select,
so with -sASYNCIFY every nested modal loop runs unchanged. All changes are inside
__EMSCRIPTEN__ guards; native builds are unchanged.
